  "description": "<p>A Tier-3 direct-effect forecast for the Silicon Sample Benchmark from Anthropic Claude Opus 4.6. Two fixed prompts elicited all 13 average treatment effects for each of 16 interventions. The two prompt-level forecasts were aggregated by their median. The entry contains 208 predictions in original outcome units and applies no post-hoc calibration or shrinkage.<\/p>",
